#+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
# This is an EXUDYN example
#
# Details:  Rigid bodies and joints: Two rigid bodies, the first hanging on the ground with a revolute joint
#           about $z$, the second hanging on the first with a revolute joint about $x$, both under gravity: a
#           double pendulum in 3D. The frames of the bodies are given as homogeneous transformations, `exu.HT`.
#
# Author:   Johannes Gerstmayr
